Resource-type: manuscript
  Label:          Manuscript
  Extends:        writtenSource
  Representation: still-image
  IRI:            http://api.dasch.swiss/ontology/0801/beol/v2#manuscript
  Data-model:     beol
  Instances:      1893

  Fields (5):
    title               text                 1-n  Title
    hasAuthor           link → person        0-n  Author
    hasText             text                 0-1  Text
    isPartOfCollection  link → Collection    0-n  is part of  [from biblio]
    hasURI              uri                  0-n  URI  [from biblio]

[anonymous on https://api.dasch.swiss] — counts include resources you may not be permitted to see and exclude deleted resources.
